l,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/dominate.webp","name":"Dominate","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You take command of the target, forcing it to obey your orders. If you issue an obviously self-destructive order, the target doesn't act until you issue a new order. The effect depends on its Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} as it fights off your commands.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You control the target. It gains the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9qGBRpbX9NEwtAAr]{Controlled} condition, but it can attempt a Will save at the end of each of its turns. On a success, the spell ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As a failure, but the target receives a new save only if you give it a new order that is against its nature, such as killing its allies.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (10th)</strong> The duration is unlimited.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"dominate","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.854,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","incapacitation","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":6},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"until the next time you make your daily preparations","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"YOpUKhfnlkJKzaja","heightenedLevel":6,"uses":{"max":2,"value":2}},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1691719726171,"modifiedTime":1691719731830,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.OsOhx3TGIZ7AhD0P","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"F00qQkHoqbEIGBEj"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/true-seeing.webp","name":"True Seeing","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You see things within 60 feet as they actually are. The GM rolls a secret counteract check against any illusion or transmutation in the area, but only for the purpose of determining whether you see through it (for instance, if the check succeeds against a polymorph spell, you can see the creature's true form, but you don't end the polymorph spell).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"true-seeing","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.854,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","revelation"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":6},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"YOpUKhfnlkJKzaja","heightenedLevel":6},"counteraction":true},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1691719737281,"modifiedTime":1691719737281,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.uqlxMQQeSGWEVjki","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"E9mgdclaAMOlJNDH"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/moon-frenzy.webp","name":"Moon Frenzy","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A feral aspect overcomes the targets, making them tough and savage. Targets gain 5 temporary Hit Points, a +10-foot status bonus to their Speeds, and weakness 5 to silver. They also grow vicious fangs and claws, which are unarmed attacks. The fangs deal 2d8 piercing damage; the claws deal 2d6 slashing damage and have the agile and finesse traits. The targets use their highest weapon or unarmed attack proficiency with these attacks, and if they have weapon specialization or greater weapon specialization, they add this damage as well. On a critical hit with one of these unarmed attacks, the creature struck takes @Damage[1d4[bleed]].</p>\n<p>The targets can't use concentrate actions unless those actions also have the rage trait, with the exception of Seek. A creature can attempt to end the spell's effect on itself by using a single action, which has the rage trait, to attempt a Will save against your spell DC; on a success, it ends the spell's effect on itself.</p>\n<p>If a target is in the light of a full moon, it also grows by one size if it were Medium or smaller. This increases the reach of a Medium or Tiny creature by 5 feet.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.zRKw95WMezr6TgiT]{Spell Effect: Moon Frenzy}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> The temporary Hit Points increase to 10, the silver weakness to 10, and the damage dealt by the attacks to three dice.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (10th)</strong> The temporary Hit Points increase to 20, the silver weakness to 20, and the damage dealt by the attacks to four dice.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"moon-frenzy","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.854,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","morph"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"up to 5 willing creatures"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"YOpUKhfnlkJKzaja","heightenedLevel":5,"uses":{"max":3,"value":3}},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1691719744907,"modifiedTime":1691719747295,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.YtesyvfAIwXOqISq","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"pekoClbn11ZQGI29"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/freedom-of-movement.webp","name":"Freedom of Movement (At Will)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You repel effects that would hinder a creature or slow its movement. While under this spell's effect, the target ignores effects that would give them a circumstance penalty to Speed. When they attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape} an effect that has them @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}, they automatically succeed unless the effect is magical and of a higher level than the freedom of movement spell.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"freedom-of-movement","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.854,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature touched"},"range":